        "id": "p3",
        "description": "A1 $= \\frac{2}{r(r + 1)(r + 2)}$.",
        "marks": 1
       }
      ]
     },
     "modelAnswer": "$$\n\\frac{1}{r(r + 1)} - \\frac{1}{(r + 1)(r + 2)} = \\frac{(r + 2) - r}{r(r + 1)(r + 2)} = \\frac{2}{r(r + 1)(r + 2)}\n$$"
    },
    "explanation": "Combine over the common denominator."
